(print "  - Ms-typed FX overloads (delay 250ms, compress 5ms 100ms, sidechain attack/release)")
(print "  - Second-decay reverb (reverb buf 0.5 1.8s) -- distinct tier from reverbTime { ... }")
(print "  - gain (decibels) vs volume (linear multiplier) -- function name documents the unit")
(print "  - Composer DX bundle: arpeggio, chord inversions, delaySync, quantize, legato, portamento, varispeed-loadWav")
(print "  - Microtonal pragmas (justIntonation / pythagorean / equalTemperament) and enable hAsB; -- companion files under examples/pragmas/")
(print "  - Scale-lint pragma (enable scaleLint;) surfaced by flow-lsp -- editor integration")
(print "  - humanizeGaussian seeded velocity perturbation for byte-identical determinism")
